# Only data/ and src/ (plus root docs) are tracked.
# Experiment outputs, logs, and cluster-specific launch scripts stay local.
/out/
/logs/
/archived_old_out/
/CLAUDE.md
/src/scripts/
/docs/
/diagnosis

# Large local data (LCB per-task tests, ~4GB; prepped via
